  "body": "## Result and review\nProves that no additional polynomial sign inequality defines the real binary unit-ball Gram locus inside its cube or convex hull for any n\u22653, and supplies a positive rational n=4 counterexample to the proposed formula. Separate full source/algebraic/normalization review passed: 8,363 author and 1,589 independent controls. The prior polygon theorem and real construction are credited, and the printed-source display issue is preserved without relying on it. No historical-priority or human peer-review claim.\n\nAll listed independent review files are retained unchanged.\n\n## Queue\nRecommended claimed_solved 2/5. Campaign coordinator will add the corresponding QUEUE.md row update to this branch.\n\nNo new human peer-review claim, merge or release requested.\n",
